      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1315214961,
      "text": "Sonneratia caseolaris, commonly known as mangrove apple, or pagatpat is a species of plant in the family Lythraceae. The fruit is noted for its outward similarity to the persimmon fruit."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Pidada merah",
